        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>2 : 1</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>3 : 7</choice_text>
          <commentary>(2² - 1²) : (4² - 3²) = 3 : 7이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3 : 10</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산식과 일치하지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
